{"id":2365,"date":"2024-09-19T12:36:36","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:36:36","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2365"},"modified":"2025-10-02T15:21:35","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T15:21:35","slug":"cardboard-paper-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-paper-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Paper Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2 data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"484\">Custom Cardboard Paper Boxes Supply<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"809\"><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/a><\/strong> offers <strong data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"539\">cardboard paper boxes<\/strong> suited to your packaging needs. Whether you&#8217;re shipping products, stocking shelves, or presenting gifts, our boxes are designed to deliver dependable performance. Available in custom sizes, styles, and finishes, our boxes combine practicality with brand presentation.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"62\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"62\">Cardboard Paper Boxes for Packaging, Storage, and Shipping<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"484\">Cardboard packaging continues to be one of the most trusted solutions for businesses needing reliable, cost-effective, and sustainable packaging. At <em data-start=\"213\" data-end=\"235\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em>, we specialize in <strong data-start=\"254\" data-end=\"286\">custom cardboard paper boxes<\/strong> at wholesale prices. Whether you&#8217;re packing cosmetics, food, electronics, apparel, or promotional kits, our boxes are made to fit the product, hold their shape, and deliver a consistent experience.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"917\">Benefits of Using Cardboard Paper Boxes for Business Packaging<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"957\">Practical and Custom-Fit Solutions<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1108\">Cardboard paper boxes offer simplicity and flexibility. They&#8217;re easy to assemble, lightweight, and available in both brown Kraft and white SBS board.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1245\">\n<li data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1144\">\n<p data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1144\">Ships flat for efficient storage<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1185\">\n<p data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1185\">Easy to customize with logos or labels<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1218\">\n<p data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1218\">Available with or without lids<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1245\">\n<p data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1245\">Printable inside and out<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1387\">Whether you\u2019re a small business or managing large-scale product shipments, these boxes make the packaging process easier and more efficient.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1392\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1431\">Types, Sizes, and Material Options<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1492\">Cardboard Paper Boxes Wholesale with Full Customization<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1609\">If you&#8217;re ordering <strong data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1548\">cardboard paper boxes wholesale<\/strong>, we give you full control over style, thickness, and sizing.<\/p>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_80l1q_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_80l1q_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"border-borderMain my-[1em] w-full table-auto border\">\n<thead class=\"bg-offset\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\">Features<\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Details and Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Material Types<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Kraft Paperboard, White SBS, Recycled Cardboard, Corrugated Cardboard, Virgin Paperboard, Coated Paperboard<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Box Styles<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Tuck-end, Two-piece, Folding Cartons, Mailer Boxes, Die-cut, Auto-bottom, Sleeve, Gable Boxes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Thickness Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">14pt, 16pt, 18pt, 20pt, 24pt, 28pt, Double-wall, Triple-wall options available<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Coating Finishes<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Gloss, Matte, Spot UV, Soft-touch (velvet feel), Satin, Aqueous Coating, Varnish, Lamination (Matte or Gloss)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Printing Methods<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">CMYK, PMS (Pantone Matching System), Offset Printing, Digital Printing, Screen Printing, Foil Stamping, Embossing\/Debossing<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Insert Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Paperboard dividers, Foam inserts, Molded pulp inserts, Plastic trays, Kraft partitions<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Minimum Order Quantity (MOQ)<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Starts at 100 units, with bulk discount pricing available<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Turnaround Time<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Typically 5 to 8 business days after design approval; expedited options may be available<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Sustainability Features<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Use of recycled materials, biodegradable coatings, FSC-certified paperboard, recyclable and compostable options<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Customization Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Custom sizes, shapes, die-cut windows, embossing, debossing, spot varnish, foil stamping, and custom color matching<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Typical Applications<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Skincare, cosmetics, perfumes, organic products, subscription boxes, gift packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2668\">These materials are food-safe, recyclable, and durable enough for retail, gifting, or e-commerce shipping.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2673\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2723\">Related Uses Like Cardboard Boxes For Bottles<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2725\" data-end=\"2944\">If you need box styles that support delicate or tall products, we also offer <a href=\"http:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-boxes-for-bottles\/\"><strong data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"2833\">Cardboard Boxes For Bottles. <\/strong><\/a>These boxes include divider inserts or partitions to safely hold glass containers, jars, and dropper bottles.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"2956\">Ideal for:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"3090\">\n<li data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"2988\">\n<p data-start=\"2960\" data-end=\"2988\">Skincare and cosmetic sets<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2989\" data-end=\"3024\">\n<p data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3024\">Wine, juice, or wellness drinks<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3066\">\n<p data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3066\">Essential oils and small-batch syrups<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3090\">\n<p data-start=\"3069\" data-end=\"3090\">Fragrance packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"3092\" data-end=\"3209\">Visit the bottle packaging section to view all styles, sizes, and protective options that support fragile containers.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3214\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"3216\" data-end=\"3253\">Key Applications Across Industries<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3312\">Uses of Cardboard Paper Boxes With Lids and Open Tops<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3314\" data-end=\"3493\">Boxes with lids are commonly used when product display, unboxing, or organized storage matters. Businesses also use lidless boxes for food trays, retail inserts, or mailing needs.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3495\" data-end=\"3523\">Common applications include:<\/p>\n<ol data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3723\">\n<li data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3561\">\n<p data-start=\"3528\" data-end=\"3561\">Apparel and fashion accessories<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3562\" data-end=\"3593\">\n<p data-start=\"3565\" data-end=\"3593\">Baked goods and snack kits<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3594\" data-end=\"3619\">\n<p data-start=\"3597\" data-end=\"3619\">Corporate gift boxes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3620\" data-end=\"3656\">\n<p data-start=\"3623\" data-end=\"3656\">Hardware and electronic devices<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3657\" data-end=\"3687\">\n<p data-start=\"3660\" data-end=\"3687\">Subscription product kits<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3688\" data-end=\"3723\">\n<p data-start=\"3691\" data-end=\"3723\">Storage boxes for home or office<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-start=\"3725\" data-end=\"3822\">We can also produce custom inserts or folding partitions if your box needs multiple compartments.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3876\">Discover Packaging Options for Different Items<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3878\" data-end=\"4220\">To help simplify product selection, we\u2019ve organized a dedicated section for categorized packaging. Our <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/packaging-for-specific-items\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"3981\" data-end=\"4094\"><strong data-start=\"3982\" data-end=\"4014\">Packaging For Specific Items<\/strong><\/a> collection lets you browse based on what you\u2019re packaging\u2014whether it&#8217;s candles, soaps, electronics, food, or beauty products.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4222\" data-end=\"4335\">This helps you find the right box format faster, depending on item fragility, dimensions, and presentation needs.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"4337\" data-end=\"4340\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"4342\" data-end=\"4390\">Why Shop Cardboard Boxes is a Reliable Choice<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"4392\" data-end=\"4430\">Support for Small and Large Orders<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4432\" data-end=\"4553\">As packaging suppliers with nationwide reach, we support clients in every industry. Here\u2019s what you get with every order:<\/p>\n<ol data-start=\"4555\" data-end=\"4878\">\n<li data-start=\"4555\" data-end=\"4606\">\n<p data-start=\"4558\" data-end=\"4606\">Custom sizing with complete design flexibility<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4607\" data-end=\"4662\">\n<p data-start=\"4610\" data-end=\"4662\">Low minimum order quantities starting at 100 units<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4663\" data-end=\"4711\">\n<p data-start=\"4666\" data-end=\"4711\">Free design support and dieline preparation<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4712\" data-end=\"4784\">\n<p data-start=\"4715\" data-end=\"4784\">Multiple box styles including foldable, rigid, or lid-based formats<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4785\" data-end=\"4837\">\n<p data-start=\"4788\" data-end=\"4837\">Premium coatings like Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4838\" data-end=\"4878\">\n<p data-start=\"4841\" data-end=\"4878\">Fast production and <strong data-start=\"4861\" data-end=\"4878\">free shipping<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-start=\"4880\" data-end=\"4963\">No hidden fees. No delays. Just reliable packaging made to support your operations.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"4965\" data-end=\"4968\" \/>\n<p data-start=\"4970\" data-end=\"5231\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"4970\" data-end=\"5042\">Need cardboard paper boxes that match your shipping or retail needs?<\/strong> Get in touch today for a quick quote. We offer <strong data-start=\"5090\" data-end=\"5125\">cardboard paper boxes with lids<\/strong>, folding cartons, mailers, and two-piece box sets\u2014all fully printable and ready to scale with your brand.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes for high-quality cardboard paper boxes at wholesale prices. We provide custom sizes and styles to fit your exact specifications. Our free design services and fast turnaround times ensure your boxes are ready when you need them. Plus, enjoy free shipping on all orders. Order now.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2478,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[185],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2365","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-packaging-for-specific-items","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Order Cardboard Paper Boxes, Wholesale Packaging | SCB<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Bulk cardboard paper boxes at wholesale prices. Perfect for businesses and retailers in need of affordable packaging. Order Today!\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-paper-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Order Cardboard Paper Boxes, Wholesale Packaging | SCB\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Bulk cardboard paper boxes at wholesale prices. Perfect for businesses and retailers in need of affordable packaging. Order Today!\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-paper-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Shop Cardboard Boxes\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-10-02T15:21:35+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/Cardboard-Paper-Boxes-1.jpg\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"1200\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image